"Say rumi or reply to my message and I'll chat with you.\nI also react to messages with emojis.\n\n/start: your snapshot and games\n/wallet /claim /pay /guard /rob /rankings\n/vault /deposit /withdraw /work /spin\n/bluff /mafia /stopmafia /mafiatop": "",
"Spend cash or gems on titles. Your equipped title shows on your /profile card and next to your name in /rankings.\n\n<b>/shop</b>\nOpens the shop with every title and its price. Owned titles show a tick. Tap a button to buy. You need to have used /start once so you have a wallet.\n\n<b>/titles</b>\nShows the titles you own. Tap one to wear it, tap Remove title to wear none. You can switch any time for free.\n\n<b>Cash titles</b>\n🌱 Fresh Face $20,000\n🎀 Sweetheart $50,000\n🎲 Lucky Charm $125,000\n🥷 Shadow $250,000\n💸 Money Maker $500,000\n🔪 Menace $750,000\n👑 Royal $1,000,000\n\n<b>Gem titles</b>\n💎 Gem Lord 150 gems\n🌙 Moonlit Legend 400 gems\n🦋 Rumi's Chosen 1,000 gems\n\n<b>Example</b>\nType /shop, tap Royal, then type /titles and tap Royal to wear it. Now /profile shows Royal under your level.\n\n<b>What members see</b>\nEveryone sees your title beside your name in /rankings. On the profile card it is shown as plain gold text, in the rankings it also has its emoji.\n\n<b>Good to know</b>\nTitles are yours forever, buying never lowers your XP or level, and the buttons only work for the person who opened the menu.": "",
"Add Rumi to your channel as admin and it keeps an eye on it for you. It never spams your channel.\n\n<b>How to start</b>\n1. Tap Add to your channel on /start.\n2. Pick your channel and keep the suggested admin rights.\n3. Rumi posts one short Protected by Rumi message with two buttons.\n\n<b>What the channel sees</b>\nOne post when Rumi joins, then one short post every 2 days. Each deletes itself after 3.5 hours, so your feed stays clean. Nothing else is ever posted there.\n\n<b>What you get privately</b>\nEvery few hours Rumi checks your member count. If it drops a lot (10 members or 10 percent, whichever is bigger), Rumi sends you one private message with the old and new count. Every week you also get a short summary with your member count and the change. You must have pressed /start with Rumi once so it can message you.\n\n<b>Example</b>\nYour channel goes from 500 to 430 members overnight. You get a private message: went from 500 to 430, minus 70.\n\n<b>What Rumi cannot do</b>\nTelegram gives bots no control over reports, so Rumi does not claim to block them. It helps you notice trouble early.\n\n<b>Good to know</b>\nRemoving Rumi from the channel stops all checks. Your data for that channel is deleted.": "",
"/clan: build or join a Clan\n/topgroups: see the top groups\n/tagall: mention everyone (admins)\n/admins: call the group admins\n/speak: Rumi speaks\n/kang: take a sticker for yourself\n/mypacks: see your sticker packs\n/id: get a user or chat ID\n/ping: check if Rumi is awake\n/setlang: choose English or Hindi\n/privacy: what Rumi keeps\n/donate: support Rumi\n/modhelp: full moderation guide": "",
"A special upgrade for your wallet and your name.\n\nWhat you get:\nA bigger, cleaner wallet card with no extra buttons, and your own emoji in front of your name.\n\n/premium: see the offer and buy it for 35 Telegram Stars. If you already have it, it tells you.\n\n/setemoji: choose the emoji shown before your name in /wallet. Three ways to use it:\n1. Reply to a message that has an emoji, then send /setemoji\n2. Send /setemoji and an emoji in the same message\n3. Forward a message that has the emoji, then send /setemoji\n\nExample: /setemoji 😼\n\nGood to know: a Telegram Premium emoji only shows as animated for people who have Telegram Premium. Others see a normal emoji.\n\nWhat members see: premium members get the PREMIUM WALLET card with their emoji before their name. Everyone else sees the normal wallet.\n\nOwner only:\n/givepremium USER_ID: give someone Premium for free\n/removepremium USER_ID: take it away\nYou can also reply to the person instead of typing the ID.\n": "",
"Earn coins by bringing people to Rumi.\n\nReferral:\n/referral: see your link and how many friends you have brought.\nShare your link. When a brand new person opens Rumi with it, you get 5,000 cash right away.\nWhen that friend reaches level 3 or has been playing for 24 hours, you get 2,000 more.\nYour friend also gets 500 cash on their first /claim.\n\nThere is no limit on how many friends you can invite. Only brand new users count, and each person can only be invited once.\n\nAdd Rumi to a group:\nAdd Rumi to a group that has 50 or more members and you get 20,000 cash.\nThis is paid once per group, so removing and re-adding Rumi does not pay again.\n\nWhat members see: Rumi posts a thank you message in the group, and you get a message when a friend joins with your link.\n": "",
"Send one message to many chats at once. Only the bot owners can use this.\n\n/broadcast: send to every group Rumi is in.\n/dmbroadcast: send to every person who uses Rumi.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Write the message you want to send (text, GIF, sticker, premium emoji, anything).\n2. Reply to that message with /broadcast or /dmbroadcast.\n3. Rumi shows a preview with Confirm and Cancel buttons. Nothing is sent until you press Confirm.\n4. After sending, press Delete broadcast to remove it from every chat.\n\nGood to know: some people never opened Rumi in DM, so a few DM sends will fail. That is normal.\n": "",
